Z||000005||Leadfoot||11-02-2001||08:13 PM||||Sorry for keeping you guys waiting right after the test drive I packed my clothes and headed out to Madison Wisconsin for a 2 day seminar....I just got back.  I wanted to get the car together before I left.  The test drive went well.  The car has more pep and doesn't hesitate upon acceleration.  However, I took it out for a spin tonight and the service engine soon light came on.  I think one of the steel hoses popped out of its boot.  I'll check it tomorrow.  Right now I am going out to a holloween party.  ||||reg||1
